<section class="hero compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">MKINITRAMFS / IMAGE BUILDER</p>
    <h1>mkinitramfs</h1>

    <p class="lead">
        Generate a compressed cpio initramfs for a kernel. The image contains
        <code>/init</code>, hook payloads, libraries, modules, firmware, and
        explicitly requested files.
    </p>

    <div class="command-line"># mkinitramfs [options] [output]</div>
</section>

